# The repository stores LF. Checkouts convert per the contributor's
# `core.autocrlf`, which is what keeps a CRLF working tree on Windows from
# reaching a commit. Prettier is pinned to `lf` for the same reason: without
# both halves, formatting a CRLF working tree rewrites every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text eol=lf
